<%- include('../partials/header', { title: 'Invoice health', user }) %>

<div class="page-header"><h1>Invoice health</h1>
  <p class="muted">Where the books disagree with themselves &mdash; and what is not in QuickBooks. Nothing here is repaired behind your back; a contradiction is information.</p></div>

<% if (notice) { %><div class="alert alert-success" style="max-width:940px;"><%= notice %></div><% } %>
<% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" style="max-width:940px;"><%= error %></div><% } %>

<style>
  .h-tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .h-tile{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;}
  .h-num{font-size:25px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.5px;}
  .h-lab{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:700;}
  .h-why{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);}
</style>

<% function money(v){ var n=Number(v)||0; return '£'+n.toLocaleString('en-GB',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2}); } %>

<div class="h-tiles">
  <div class="h-tile"><div class="h-lab">Showing as owed</div><div class="h-num"><%= money(owed) %></div>
    <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px;">Across every issued, unpaid invoice</div></div>
  <div class="h-tile"><div class="h-lab">Not in QuickBooks</div><div class="h-num"><%= notInQb.n %></div>
    <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px;"><%= money(notInQb.v) %> &mdash; <a class="row-link" href="/invoices?qb=no">see them</a></div></div>
  <div class="h-tile"><div class="h-lab">Contradictions</div><div class="h-num"><%= (rows||[]).length %></div>
    <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px;">Rows whose two answers disagree</div></div>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
  <h2 style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:16px;">The safe repair</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:0 0 10px;">
    An issued, unpaid invoice showing <strong>nothing owed</strong> has simply never had its balance set &mdash; the column defaults to zero and none of the ten places that create or recalculate an invoice ever wrote it.
    Setting it to the total cannot lose anything, because there was nothing there. A part-payment balance written deliberately is left alone.
  </p>
  <form method="post" action="/invoices/health/verify-qb" style="margin:0 0 10px;"
        onsubmit="return confirm('Ask QuickBooks which invoice numbers it actually holds, and compare.\n\nNo invoices are created or changed in QuickBooks. Where the Portal claims an invoice is in QuickBooks and QuickBooks disagrees, the false link is cleared so the invoice can be sent again.');">
    <button class="btn" type="submit">Ask QuickBooks what it actually has</button>
  </form>
  <form method="post" action="/invoices/health/fix-balances" style="margin:0;"
        onsubmit="return confirm('Two repairs:\n\n1. Set the balance to the invoice total on every issued, unpaid invoice showing nothing owed. Paid, void and part-paid invoices are not touched.\n\n2. Stamp an issue date on any issued invoice that has none, taken from the date it was created. An invoice with no issue date has no tax point, so it belongs to no VAT quarter.');">
    <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Set the missing balances and dates</button>
  </form>
</div>

<div class="card" style="padding:0;margin-bottom:18px;">
  <div class="card-header" style="padding:16px 20px 12px;">
    <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:16px;">Never reached QuickBooks <span class="muted">(<%= (qbGap||[]).length %>)</span></h2>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:4px 0 0;">
      Issued invoices with no QuickBooks record. The <strong>why</strong> column is the thing that was missing:
      a bill run that could not push wrote &ldquo;QB skipped&rdquo; into an audit log and carried on, so an invoice that never went
      looked exactly like one that did.
    </p>
  </div>
  <% if (!(qbGap||[]).length) { %>
    <div class="empty-state" style="margin:0;padding:22px;">Every issued invoice is in QuickBooks.</div>
  <% } else { %>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th>Invoice</th><th>Customer</th><th style="text-align:right;">Total</th><th>Issued</th><th>Last attempt</th><th>Why it is not there</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <% qbGap.forEach(function(g){ %>
          <tr>
            <td><a class="row-link" href="/invoices/<%= g.id %>"><%= g.invoice_number || ('#' + g.id) %></a></td>
            <td class="muted"><%= g.customer_name || '—' %></td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><%= money(g.total) %></td>
            <td class="muted"><%= g.issue_date ? new Date(g.issue_date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB') : '—' %></td>
            <td class="muted" style="font-size:12px;">
              <% if (g.qb_push_state) { %><span class="badge"><%= g.qb_push_state %></span> <%= g.qb_push_at ? new Date(g.qb_push_at).toLocaleDateString('en-GB') : '' %>
              <% } else { %><span class="muted">never tried</span><% } %>
            </td>
            <td class="h-why">
              <% if (g.qb_push_error) { %><%= g.qb_push_error %>
              <% } else if (!g.qb_push_state) { %>Nothing has ever attempted to send this one.
              <% } else { %>Recorded as <%= g.qb_push_state %>, but QuickBooks holds no id for it.<% } %>
            </td>
          </tr>
        <% }); %>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  <% } %>
</div>
<div class="card" style="padding:0;">
  <div class="card-header" style="padding:16px 20px 12px;">
    <h2 style="margin:0;font-size:16px;">Contradictions <span class="muted">(<%= (rows||[]).length %>)</span></h2>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin:4px 0 0;">Biggest first. Each row is a question, not a fault to be swept away.</p>
  </div>
  <% if (!(rows||[]).length) { %>
    <div class="empty-state" style="margin:0;padding:22px;">Every invoice agrees with itself.</div>
  <% } else { %>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="table">
      <thead><tr><th>Invoice</th><th>Customer</th><th style="text-align:right;">Total</th><th style="text-align:right;">Balance</th><th>Status</th><th>Payment</th><th>What disagrees</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <% rows.forEach(function(r){ %>
          <tr>
            <td><a class="row-link" href="/invoices/<%= r.id %>"><%= r.invoice_number || ('#' + r.id) %></a></td>
            <td class="muted"><%= r.customer_name || '—' %></td>
            <td style="text-align:right;"><%= money(r.total) %></td>
            <td style="text-align:right;<%= (Number(r.balance)||0) === 0 ? 'color:var(--bad-fg,#a12626);font-weight:700;' : '' %>"><%= money(r.balance) %></td>
            <td><span class="badge"><%= r.status %></span></td>
            <td><span class="badge"><%= r.payment_status %></span></td>
            <td class="h-why"><%= r.why %></td>
          </tr>
        <% }); %>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  <% } %>
</div>

<%# ── The unlock passphrase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    The route has always existed; nothing ever posted to it, so there was no way to set
    one and the unlock box on an invoice refused every time. autocomplete is off and the
    boxes are new-password, or Chrome offers a saved login into a shared passphrase. %>
<div class="card" style="margin-top:18px;">
  <h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0 0 4px;">Invoice unlock passphrase</h2>
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:12.5px;margin:0 0 12px;max-width:70ch;">
    An issued invoice is locked because the customer and QuickBooks already hold it. This passphrase
    suspends that lock for 30 minutes, on one invoice, and the unlock is recorded against it.
    <% if (typeof unlockSet !== 'undefined' && unlockSet) { %>
      <strong>One is set.</strong> Enter the current one to change it.
    <% } else { %>
      <strong>None is set yet — the unlock button on an invoice will refuse until you set one.</strong>
    <% } %>
  </p>
  <form method="post" action="/invoices/unlock-passphrase" autocomplete="off"
        style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;">
    <% if (typeof unlockSet !== 'undefined' && unlockSet) { %>
      <input class="input" type="password" name="current_passphrase" placeholder="Current passphrase" required
             autocomplete="new-password" data-lpignore="true" data-1p-ignore style="max-width:200px;font-size:13px;">
    <% } %>
    <input class="input" type="password" name="new_passphrase" placeholder="New passphrase" required minlength="6"
           autocomplete="new-password" data-lpignore="true" data-1p-ignore style="max-width:200px;font-size:13px;">
    <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit"><%= (typeof unlockSet !== 'undefined' && unlockSet) ? 'Change it' : 'Set it' %></button>
    <span class="muted" style="font-size:11.5px;">At least 6 characters. Stored hashed &mdash; it is never written to the code or the repo.</span>
  </form>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
